Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.21,0:00:01.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（《星际迷航》）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.42,0:00:03.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（《克林贡语字典》）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.01,0:00:12.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Time. All right, Klingons, pencils down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.01,0:00:12.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}时间到 好吧 克林贡人 笔放下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.47,0:00:15.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I have pokh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.47,0:00:15.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 我有波克
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.10,0:00:17.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ALL: Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.10,0:00:17.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.73,0:00:18.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SPEAKING IN KLINGON]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.73,0:00:18.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.98,0:00:20.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ALL: Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.98,0:00:20.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:22.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:24.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我有抠儿 -有了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.36,0:00:24.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I have chorrr. ALL: Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.57,0:00:26.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ALL: Yeah. -And kreplach.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.57,0:00:26.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-有了 -还有克瑞普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.48,0:00:29.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hold on a second, kreplach? -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.48,0:00:29.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-慢着 克瑞普拉？ -没错
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.53,0:00:32.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That isn't Klingon. It's Yiddish for meat-filled dumpling.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.53,0:00:32.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这不是克林贡语 这是意第绪语 肉饺的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.78,0:00:35.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, as it turns out, it's also a Klingon word.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.78,0:00:35.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你猜怎么着 刚好也是克林贡语
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.62,0:00:37.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? Define it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.62,0:00:37.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗？什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.04,0:00:41.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Kreplach, a hearty Klingon dumpling.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.04,0:00:41.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}克瑞普拉 意指好吃的克林贡饺子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.92,0:00:43.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Judge's ruling?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.92,0:00:43.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}裁判怎么说？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.17,0:00:44.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SPEAKS IN KLINGON]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.59,0:00:48.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, guys. I need to use your TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.59,0:00:48.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位 我要借你们的电视看
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.55,0:00:52.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What's wrong with your TV? -I don't know. Just died. I'm getting static.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.55,0:00:52.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你的电视怎么了？ -我不知道 不能看 全是干扰
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.39,0:00:54.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you pay your cable bill?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.39,0:00:54.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有付有线电视帐单吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.26,0:00:56.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ugh. You sound just like the cable company.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.26,0:00:56.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的口气听起来就和有线电视公司的人一样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.14,0:01:01.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, so shh. Tyra Banks is about to kick someone off America's Next Top Model.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.14,0:01:01.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《全美超模大赛》的泰拉班克斯又要淘汰一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.27,0:01:03.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Excuse me, Penny, but we're-- -Don't tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.27,0:01:03.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-抱歉 佩妮 我们正在… -别告诉她
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.65,0:01:05.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}--playing Klingon Boggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.65,0:01:06.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}玩克林贡字谜游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.15,0:01:06.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[GROANS]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.65,0:01:09.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do you mean, "Ohh?" Like she didn't know we were nerds?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.65,0:01:09.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你哦什么？你难道不认为她早就知道我们是书呆子？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.99,0:01:13.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, if you must watch, then mute it with closed captions, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.99,0:01:13.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 如果你一定要看 请按静音 无字幕
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.74,0:01:15.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.74,0:01:15.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.33,0:01:21.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, Boggle warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.33,0:01:21.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 字谜战士们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.29,0:01:22.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SPEAKS IN KLINGON]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.67,0:01:31.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look at those women.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.67,0:01:31.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瞧瞧这些女人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.55,0:01:33.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They're gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.55,0:01:33.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她们太美了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.84,0:01:35.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, worf. Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.84,0:01:35.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}沃夫 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.68,0:01:38.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Too bad that's a proper noun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.68,0:01:38.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真可惜是个专有名词
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.60,0:01:41.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, look, there's the future Mrs. Wolowitz.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.60,0:01:41.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们瞧 这位就是未来的沃洛维茨太太
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.94,0:01:44.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No wait, that's the future Mrs. Wolowitz.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.94,0:01:44.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 等等 这位才是未来的沃洛维茨太太
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:46.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}With her head in the lap of--
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:46.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她的头就放在…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.02,0:01:49.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What a coincidence. It's the future Mrs. Wolowitz.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.02,0:01:49.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真是巧合 未来的沃洛维茨太太就是她了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.86,0:01:52.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, and they can all move in with you and your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.86,0:01:52.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错 她们都可以与你一起跟你妈住
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.70,0:01:57.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The current Mrs. Wolowitz.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.70,0:01:57.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也就是目前的沃洛维茨太太
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.95,0:02:03.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is qochbe spelled with a "qo" or a "ko?"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.95,0:02:03.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}科区比是怎么拼的？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.00,0:02:06.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why is that Mrs. Wolowitz crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.00,0:02:06.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为何这位沃洛维茨太太在哭？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.38,0:02:09.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, that's Anaïs. None of the other girls in the house like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.38,0:02:09.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她叫阿娜依 屋子里的其他人都不喜欢她
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.00,0:02:12.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}House? What house?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.00,0:02:12.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}屋子？什么屋子？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.67,0:02:15.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-They all live in a house together. -A house? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.67,0:02:15.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-她们都住在同一幢屋子里 -屋子？在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.39,0:02:18.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know. Somewhere in L.A.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.39,0:02:18.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道 就在洛杉矶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.80,0:02:20.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.80,0:02:20.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.14,0:02:26.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're telling me that I'm within driving distance...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.14,0:02:26.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是说 在我们开车就能到的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.73,0:02:30.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...of a house filled with aspiring supermodels?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.73,0:02:30.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有一间屋子 里面全是超级模特儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.23,0:02:32.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.23,0:02:32.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想就是这个意思
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.36,0:02:37.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And they live together and shower together...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.36,0:02:37.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她们一起住、一起洗澡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.41,0:02:41.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and have naked pillow fights?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.41,0:02:41.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}半裸着打枕头仗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.50,0:02:47.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey, where are you going? -To pay my cable bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.50,0:02:47.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你要去哪里？ -去付有线电视帐单
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.25,0:02:51.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, pencils down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.25,0:02:51.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 笔放下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:53.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have lokh, makh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:53.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有罗克、马克
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.88,0:02:56.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and cherrrkh. Anybody got those?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.88,0:02:56.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有车克 你们也有吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.20,0:03:24.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CHATTERING ON TV]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.33,0:03:29.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did I miss anything? Did they kick Giselle off?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.33,0:03:29.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有没有错过什么？她们把吉赛儿踢出去了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.67,0:03:33.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not yet, but her underwater photo shoot was an embarrassment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.67,0:03:33.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还没 但是她在水底拍照项目表现欠佳
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.96,0:03:38.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sadly, Mrs. Giselle Wolowitz is sensitive to chlorine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.96,0:03:38.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真遗憾 吉赛儿沃洛维茨太太对氯过敏
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.18,0:03:43.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Lucky for her I like my fashion models pruny and bug-eyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.18,0:03:43.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}值得庆幸的是 我喜欢瘦巴巴、眼睛浮肿的模特儿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.31,0:03:45.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, the food's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.31,0:03:45.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 开饭了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.81,0:03:47.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, there's the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.81,0:03:47.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是这间屋子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.06,0:03:49.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Freeze frame, freeze frame.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.06,0:03:49.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}赶快按暂停
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.98,0:03:58.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What are you doing? -Marking the positions and landmarks...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.98,0:03:58.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你在做什么？ -标记位置跟地标…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.03,0:04:01.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...so we can find the house of the supermodels.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.03,0:04:01.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好让我们找到超级模特儿住的屋子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.41,0:04:04.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Why? -Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.41,0:04:04.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-为什么？ -这还不够明显吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.37,0:04:06.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Every week they kick out a beautiful girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.37,0:04:06.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她们每周淘汰一名漂亮女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.54,0:04:10.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...making her feel unwanted and without self-esteem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.54,0:04:10.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让她感觉没人要 缺乏自尊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.54,0:04:14.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A.k.a. the future Mrs. Howard Wolowitz.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.54,0:04:14.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也就是未来的霍华德沃洛维茨太太
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.84,0:04:17.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Is my hamburger medium-well? -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.84,0:04:17.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我的汉堡五分熟？ -是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.72,0:04:19.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Dill slices, not sweet? -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.72,0:04:19.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-时萝香料 不放糖？ -是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.22,0:04:21.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Individual relish packets? Onion rings? -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.22,0:04:21.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-调味包另外放？洋葱圈？ -是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.68,0:04:24.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Extra breading? What did they say? -I asked. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.68,0:04:24.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-面包多一点？他们怎么说？ -我问过了 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.10,0:04:26.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Did you protest? Vociferously? -Yes. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.10,0:04:26.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你抗议了吗？严正抗议？ -有 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.52,0:04:28.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, then, what took you so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.52,0:04:28.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你怎么去了这么久？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.23,0:04:32.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.23,0:04:32.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}赶快吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.40,0:04:36.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey, guys. What'd I miss, what'd I miss? -Giselle's hanging by a thread.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.40,0:04:36.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我错过了什么好戏吗？ -吉赛儿快被踢出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.19,0:04:38.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, good, I hate her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.19,0:04:38.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很好 反正我讨厌她
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.61,0:04:41.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then you're not invited to our wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.61,0:04:41.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那我们结婚不会邀请你来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.36,0:04:43.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Here you go. -Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.36,0:04:43.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-给你 -谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.78,0:04:45.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, do we have to suffer...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.78,0:04:45.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们还要再忍受一次…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.33,0:04:48.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...through this transparently manipulative, pseudo-reality again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.33,0:04:48.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这种明显人为操纵的虚假实境节目吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.50,0:04:49.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ALL: Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.50,0:04:49.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.00,0:04:52.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You and I have a standing TV schedule...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.00,0:04:52.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你跟我定下的电视节目时间
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.08,0:04:54.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...the result of extensive debate and compromise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.08,0:04:54.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是经过冗长的辩论跟妥协
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.59,0:04:56.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Any alterations except for breaking news...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.59,0:04:56.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}除了突发新闻以外任何其他的改变
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.76,0:05:00.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...have to be pre-approved at the weekly roommate meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.76,0:05:00.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}都必须提交到每周一次的室友会议讨论通过
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.76,0:05:02.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Put it on the agenda.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.76,0:05:02.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}排上议程吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.01,0:05:03.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have to make a motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.01,0:05:03.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你得先提动议
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.76,0:05:06.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll make a motion but you're not gonna like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.76,0:05:06.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可以提动议 但你未必会喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.43,0:05:11.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine. Mock parliamentary procedure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.43,0:05:11.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 就会取笑议事程序
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.14,0:05:12.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}At least put it on mute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.14,0:05:12.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}至少按下静音吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.69,0:05:15.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, Giselle's not getting kicked off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.69,0:05:15.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}吉赛儿不会被踢出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.90,0:05:17.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's totally gonna be Summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.90,0:05:17.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}出局的一定是桑茉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.44,0:05:18.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SQUEALS]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.61,0:05:23.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What? -Sheldon's onion ring. Just put it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.61,0:05:23.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-怎么了？ -谢尔顿的洋葱圈 赶快放回去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.32,0:05:26.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-It's one onion ring. -Just put it back before he comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.32,0:05:26.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-只不过是一个洋葱圈 -在他回来前 赶快放回去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.04,0:05:28.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't think that's where it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.04,0:05:28.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}原本不是放在那里的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.74,0:05:32.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, here he comes. Deny, deny, deny, people. Wall of silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.74,0:05:32.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他来了 全面否认 大家一致沉默
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.88,0:05:39.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Who touched my--? -Penny. Penny did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.88,0:05:39.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谁碰了我的… -佩妮…佩妮碰的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.30,0:05:43.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.30,0:05:43.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为何要这么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.76,0:05:46.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know. I was hungry? What's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.76,0:05:46.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道 我肚子饿了 这有什么大不了的？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.18,0:05:49.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The big deal is that nobody touches food on my plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.18,0:05:49.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大不了的原因在于没有人可以碰我的食物
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.77,0:05:51.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right. I didn't know. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.77,0:05:51.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我不知情 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.64,0:05:55.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I'm sorry, but that is your second strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.64,0:05:55.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很抱歉 你已经两好球了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.82,0:06:00.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What? -You have two strikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.82,0:06:00.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么？ -你已经两好球了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.94,0:06:03.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Three strikes and you're out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.94,0:06:03.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}三好球 你就三振出局了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.57,0:06:06.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a sports metaphor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.57,0:06:06.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是运动用语
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.53,0:06:09.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-A sports metaphor? -Yes, baseball.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.53,0:06:09.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-运动用语？ -棒球
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.75,0:06:14.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, yeah, I'll play along.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.75,0:06:14.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 依照你的逻辑
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.50,0:06:16.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What was my first strike? -March 18th.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.50,0:06:16.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-一好球是什么时候？ -3月18日
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.63,0:06:20.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You violated my rule about forwarding e-mail humor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.63,0:06:20.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你违反了我关于转寄电子邮件笑话的规定
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.88,0:06:22.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.88,0:06:22.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.13,0:06:26.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The photo of the cat who wants to "Has Cheezburger?"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.13,0:06:26.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}想要吃乳酪汉堡的小猫照片
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.34,0:06:29.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, come on, everybody loves Lolcats.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.34,0:06:29.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别这样 大家都喜欢小猫
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.18,0:06:32.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They're cute and they can't spell...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.18,0:06:32.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它们很可爱 而且不会拼字
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.18,0:06:34.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...because they're cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.18,0:06:34.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为它们只是小猫
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.85,0:06:38.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I trusted you with my e-mail address and you betrayed that trust...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.85,0:06:38.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我给你我的电子邮件地址 你却辜负了我的信任
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.15,0:06:40.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...by sending me Internet banality. Strike one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.15,0:06:40.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}居然寄给我网络无聊玩意儿 一好球
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.98,0:06:43.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Touching my food, strike two.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.98,0:06:43.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}碰我的食物 两好球
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.99,0:06:49.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't worry, they only stay on your record for a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.99,0:06:49.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别紧张 记录只有一年期限
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.20,0:06:53.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can get them removed early but you have to take his class.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.20,0:06:53.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可以提早撤销 不过你得上他的课才行
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.70,0:06:58.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, come on, I touched one onion ring. -And then you put it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.70,0:06:58.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-拜托 我只碰了一个洋葱圈 -然后你又放了回去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.92,0:07:02.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Compromising the integrity of all the other onion rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.92,0:07:02.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}破坏了所有洋葱圈的完整性
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.84,0:07:07.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, honey, the buses don't go where you live, do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.84,0:07:07.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亲爱的 你跟我住在不同星球 是不是？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.39,0:07:11.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, I wish I could be more lenient with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.39,0:07:11.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 但愿我能对你宽容一些
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.68,0:07:14.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But since you've become a permanent member...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.68,0:07:14.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但既然你已经成为我们永久的一员
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.06,0:07:17.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I've to hold you to the same standards as everybody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.06,0:07:17.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就必须用对待其他人的标准来对你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.02,0:07:20.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Congratulations, you're officially one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.02,0:07:20.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}恭喜你 你正式成为我们其中一员
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.77,0:07:22.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CHANTS] One of us, one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.77,0:07:22.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们的一员…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.99,0:07:27.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, what a thrill.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.99,0:07:27.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真是惊喜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.20,0:07:30.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You're sitting in my spot. -Oh, gee, you've gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.20,0:07:30.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你坐在我的位置上了 -你在寻我开心吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.91,0:07:33.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Leonard, she's in my spot. -Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.91,0:07:33.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-莱纳德 她坐在我的位置上 -对…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.87,0:07:35.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See, here's the thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.87,0:07:35.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事情是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.20,0:07:39.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...after you leave, I still have to live with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.20,0:07:39.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你走了之后 我还要跟他住在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.04,0:07:42.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't care. I'm taking a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.04,0:07:42.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不管 我要坚守原则
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.75,0:07:44.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Metaphorically.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.75,0:07:44.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}象征性
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.09,0:07:46.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.09,0:07:46.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 你自找的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.97,0:07:51.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Strike three. -Oh, strike three.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.97,0:07:51.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-三好球 -三好球
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.76,0:07:53.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm banished?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.76,0:07:53.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我被驱逐出境？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.22,0:07:55.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What the hell kind of crap is that? LEONARD: Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.22,0:07:55.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这是哪门子的道理？ -听着
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.14,0:07:58.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Don't worry, I'll talk to him. -Yeah, you do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.14,0:07:58.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-别担心 我会跟他谈谈 -你最好这样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.64,0:08:02.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just so I know, would you be open to taking his class?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.64,0:08:02.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只想了解一下 你愿不愿意上他的课？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.90,0:08:08.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can do it online.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.90,0:08:08.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可以通过网络上课哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.95,0:08:13.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So on our triangulation, we've narrowed the location of the Top Model house...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.95,0:08:13.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}根据三角测量的结果 我们已经缩小超级模特儿屋子的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.78,0:08:16.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to three square miles in the Hollywood Hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.78,0:08:16.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在好莱坞山方圆7点8平方公里的范围
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.62,0:08:19.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or possibly Durham, North Carolina.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.62,0:08:19.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或者是北卡罗莱纳州的德罕
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.79,0:08:21.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When we find it, wanna go with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.79,0:08:21.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我们找到屋子 你要跟我们去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.04,0:08:26.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-To do what? -Party with the pretty girls, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.04,0:08:26.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-去做什么？ -跟美女们开派对狂欢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.55,0:08:29.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you insane? You're not gonna party with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.55,0:08:29.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你疯了吗？你不可能跟她们一起狂欢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.26,0:08:31.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're not even gonna get near that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.26,0:08:31.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你甚至不可能接近那个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.30,0:08:34.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's what they said to Neil Armstrong about the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.30,0:08:34.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}以前 阿姆斯特朗也曾被人嘲笑过
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.97,0:08:37.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No one said anything of the kind to Neil Armstrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.97,0:08:37.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有人这么嘲笑过阿姆斯特朗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.48,0:08:40.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The entire nation dedicated a decade of effort and treasure...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.48,0:08:40.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}整个国家花了十年的努力与财力
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.52,0:08:41.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to put a man on the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.52,0:08:41.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}把他送上月球
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.98,0:08:44.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My fellow Americans, before this year is out...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.98,0:08:44.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位美国同胞 在年底以前
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.48,0:08:48.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...we will put a Wolowitz on one of America's Top Models.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.48,0:08:48.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}全美超级模特儿之一将成为沃洛维茨太太
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.61,0:08:53.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And a large number of people will believe it never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.61,0:08:53.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}许多人甚至不相信这是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.37,0:08:55.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.37,0:08:55.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 让我猜猜看
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.62,0:08:57.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Quesadilla with soy cheese...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.62,0:08:57.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}夹了豆腐乳酪的墨西哥卷饼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.24,0:08:59.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-...for lactose-intolerant Leonard. -Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.24,0:08:59.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-因为莱纳德的乳糖不耐症 -谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.54,0:09:02.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Shrimp caesar salad with no almonds for the highly allergic...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.54,0:09:02.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}鲜虾凯萨沙拉 不加杏仁果 因为霍华德容易过敏
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.71,0:09:05.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...kosher-only-on-the-High-Holidays Howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.71,0:09:05.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只在过节时才吃犹太传统食物
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.25,0:09:07.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And for our suddenly-back-on-the-Hindu-wagon Raj...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.25,0:09:07.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}至于给我们回归印度的拉吉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.92,0:09:09.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...meat lover's pizza, no meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.92,0:09:09.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}肉类爱好者的披萨 不加肉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.72,0:09:13.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Coming right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.72,0:09:13.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}马上就来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.30,0:09:16.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait. Excuse me. You forgot my barbecue bacon cheeseburger...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.30,0:09:16.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等 你忘了我的烧烤培根乳酪汉堡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.81,0:09:19.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...barbecue sauce, bacon and cheese on the side.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.81,0:09:19.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}烧烤酱与培根、乳酪另外放
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.43,0:09:21.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I didn't tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.43,0:09:21.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}难道我没告诉你吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.31,0:09:24.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're banished from the Cheesecake Factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.31,0:09:24.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你被芝乐坊驱逐了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.81,0:09:27.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Why? -Well, you have three strikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.81,0:09:27.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-为什么？ -你有三好球
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.69,0:09:30.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}One, coming in. Two, sitting down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.69,0:09:30.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一好球 走进门 二好球 坐下来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.57,0:09:33.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And three, I don't like your attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.57,0:09:33.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}三好球 我不喜欢你的态度
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.36,0:09:36.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can't do that. Not only is it a violation of California State Law...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.36,0:09:36.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不能这么做 这不仅违反了加州法律…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.99,0:09:40.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...it flies directly in the face of Cheesecake Factory policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.99,0:09:40.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也与芝乐坊的规定相抵触
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.16,0:09:44.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, no, there's a new policy: No shoes, no shirt, no Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.16,0:09:44.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有一条新规定 没穿鞋、没穿上衣、谢尔顿勿进
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.54,0:09:48.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I bet we could sell that sign all over Pasadena.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.54,0:09:48.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}帕萨迪纳全区一定非常欢迎这新规定
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.51,0:09:52.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Penny, can I talk to you for a minute? -Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.51,0:09:52.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 可否私下谈谈？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.05,0:09:56.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hi. -Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.05,0:09:56.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你好 -你好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.01,0:09:58.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.01,0:09:58.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事情是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.35,0:10:02.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I talked to Sheldon and he feels terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.35,0:10:02.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我跟谢尔顿谈过 他觉得很后悔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.02,0:10:05.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And he agrees that he was unreasonable and out of line.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.02,0:10:05.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他承认他不讲道理 行事逾矩
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.86,0:10:08.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Really? Well, that's great. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.86,0:10:08.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真的吗？太好了 -是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.44,0:10:10.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, just apologize to him, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.44,0:10:10.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟他道歉就行了 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.15,0:10:13.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? I'm not gonna apologize to that nutcase.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.15,0:10:13.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？我才不要向那个疯子道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.74,0:10:17.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, it's easy. He'll even tell you what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.74,0:10:17.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别这样 其实很容易 他甚至会教你该怎么说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.91,0:10:22.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't you get it? You keep going along with his insanity, you're encouraging him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.91,0:10:22.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不懂吗？你们继续让他这样下去等于是在纵容他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.04,0:10:26.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're not encouraging. It's more like knuckling under.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.04,0:10:26.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们没有纵容他 我们只是屈服
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.25,0:10:31.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I like hanging out but I'm not gonna apologize for something I didn't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.25,0:10:31.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我喜欢跟你们做朋友 但我才不要为了我没做的事道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.05,0:10:34.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, actually, technically you did do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.05,0:10:34.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事实上 严格说 你的确做了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.84,0:10:38.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's strike one, Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.84,0:10:38.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一好球 莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.26,0:10:41.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here you go. Quesadilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.26,0:10:41.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个给你 墨西哥卷饼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.47,0:10:42.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Salad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.47,0:10:42.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}沙拉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.77,0:10:44.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here's your pizza.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.77,0:10:44.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是你的披萨
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.31,0:10:47.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And thanks to Sheldon's heated discussion with my manager...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.31,0:10:47.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}归功于谢尔顿跟店长的热烈讨论
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.73,0:10:52.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...barbecue bacon cheeseburger, barbecue sauce, bacon and cheese on the side.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.73,0:10:52.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}烧烤培根乳酪汉堡 烧烤酱与培根、乳酪另外放
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.36,0:10:54.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.36,0:10:54.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.78,0:10:56.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Go ahead. Eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.78,0:10:56.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快点吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.20,0:11:03.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I dare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.20,0:11:03.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我赌你不敢吃
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.34,0:11:13.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's it. There's the house. I found America's top models!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.34,0:11:13.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}找到屋子了 我找到全美超级模特儿了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.67,0:11:15.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Are you sure? -Look. On the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.67,0:11:15.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你肯定？ -你看 就在屋顶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.42,0:11:18.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anaïs and Giselle are sunbathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.42,0:11:18.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}阿娜依与吉赛儿正在日光浴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.89,0:11:21.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}European style.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.89,0:11:21.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}欧洲风格
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.06,0:11:24.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can recognize people on Google Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.06,0:11:24.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谷歌地图上可以看到人？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.18,0:11:29.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course not. I got a buddy of mine at NORAD to have a spy drone fly over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.18,0:11:29.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然不行 北美防空司令部的哥儿们派遣侦察机飞过
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.69,0:11:32.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}NORAD? You're using military aircraft?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.69,0:11:32.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}北美防空司令部？你擅用军事飞机？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.28,0:11:36.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was already targeted to poke around a nuclear reactor in Siberia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.28,0:11:36.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它反正早就锁定西伯利亚附近的核子反应炉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.15,0:11:38.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I took it an hour out of its way, tops.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.15,0:11:38.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我顶多只挪用了一个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.41,0:11:41.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.41,0:11:41.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 他在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.70,0:11:44.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon? I dropped him off at the comic book store.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.70,0:11:44.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿？我刚刚送他去漫画店了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.83,0:11:47.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here. Try and go online.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.83,0:11:47.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}试着上网看看
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.04,0:11:49.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Problem with the Wi-Fi? -No, just try.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.04,0:11:49.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-无线网络有问题？ -不是 试试就对了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.21,0:11:52.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Greetings, hamburger-toucher.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.21,0:11:52.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好 碰我汉堡的人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.84,0:11:57.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You are probably wondering why you cannot IM with your little friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.84,0:11:57.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你大概正在狐疑何以无法跟你朋友即时通讯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.47,0:12:00.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...about how much you heart various things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.47,0:12:00.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}分享生活里的各种事情
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.14,0:12:04.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, this recorded message is alerting you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.14,0:12:04.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个信息就是要警告你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.06,0:12:08.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that I am putting an end to your parasitic piggybacking upon our Wi-Fi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.06,0:12:08.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不会再让你这个寄生虫偷用我们的无线网络
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.27,0:12:10.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you want to remedy the situation...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.27,0:12:10.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你想解决这个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.56,0:12:14.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you can contact the phone company, set up your own Wi-Fi and pay for it...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.56,0:12:14.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请联络电话公司 设定无线网络 自己付钱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.69,0:12:18.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...or you may apologize to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.69,0:12:18.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或者 你可以向我道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.82,0:12:23.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Well? -I reiterate. Knuckle under.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.82,0:12:23.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你觉得如何？ -我再说一次 我们屈服了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.24,0:12:26.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no, no, no. It is on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.24,0:12:26.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不…好戏上场了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.08,0:12:28.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm gonna introduce your friend to a world of hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.08,0:12:28.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要让你朋友知道痛苦是什么滋味
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.66,0:12:31.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, Penny, you don't wanna get into it with Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.66,0:12:31.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 你不会想跟谢尔顿交手的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.29,0:12:35.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The guy's one lab accident away from being a super villain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.29,0:12:35.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这家伙只差一步就成了超级大坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.17,0:12:41.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't care. I was in junior rodeo. I can hogtie and castrate him in 60 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.17,0:12:41.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不在乎 我参加过牛仔竞技 可以在60秒内搞定他 把他阉了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.76,0:12:46.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No need to neuter the nerd. I can get you back online.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.76,0:12:46.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有必要阉了这个疯子 我来帮你上网
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.43,0:12:47.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.43,0:12:47.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.68,0:12:49.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Problem solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.68,0:12:49.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}问题解决了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.77,0:12:51.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Voilà.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.10,0:12:55.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: Hello, puny insects.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.10,0:12:55.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位好 小虫子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.07,0:12:58.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}As a consequence of your efforts to circumvent my will...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.07,0:12:58.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有鉴于你们想要规避我的意愿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.03,0:13:02.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...everyone is awarded one additional strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.03,0:13:02.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}每个人各得一好球
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.62,0:13:05.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks a lot, Howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.62,0:13:05.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德 多谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.29,0:13:10.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you complaining about? I'm the one who has to take the class again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.29,0:13:10.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在抱怨什么？我才是那个得去上课的人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.96,0:13:18.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.80,0:13:21.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.80,0:13:21.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.64,0:13:24.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Time to do your laundry, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.64,0:13:24.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}洗衣时间到了 是不是？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.30,0:13:26.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Saturday night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.30,0:13:26.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}周六晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.64,0:13:28.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Saturday is laundry night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.64,0:13:28.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}周六是洗衣日
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.02,0:13:30.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.02,0:13:30.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.56,0:13:33.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Every Saturday at 8:15.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.56,0:13:33.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}每周六8点15分
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.31,0:13:36.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Easy to anticipate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.31,0:13:36.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很容易预测
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.11,0:13:39.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: What are you implying?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.11,0:13:39.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在暗示什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.78,0:13:42.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm implying that you're a creature of habit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.78,0:13:42.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在暗示你是个有习惯性的动物
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.82,0:13:47.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And if something were to prevent you from doing your laundry on Saturday at 8:15...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.82,0:13:47.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果意外发生 让你无法在周六8点15分洗衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.20,0:13:49.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you might find it...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.20,0:13:49.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你会觉得…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.62,0:13:51.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...unpleasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.62,0:13:51.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很不高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.34,0:13:59.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Knuckle under, my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.34,0:13:59.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我才不要屈服呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.72,0:14:08.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.72,0:14:08.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦 不
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.47,0:14:11.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are all the machines taken?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.47,0:14:11.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}每一台洗衣机都有人用了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.10,0:14:15.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.10,0:14:15.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你该怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.10,0:14:17.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.10,0:14:17.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.65,0:14:21.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll just do my laundry another night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.65,0:14:21.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我另外找时间洗衣服就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.53,0:14:23.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Another night?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.53,0:14:23.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}另外找时间？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.15,0:14:25.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I guess you can try...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.15,0:14:25.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然 你可以试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.20,0:14:31.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but deep inside your heart you'll know that laundry night is always Saturday night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.20,0:14:31.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你内心深处很清楚地知道 周六晚上才是洗衣日
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.42,0:14:39.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Woman, you are playing with forces beyond your ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.42,0:14:39.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}女人 你这是自不量力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.50,0:14:42.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, well, your Ken can kiss my Barbie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.50,0:14:42.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有本事放马过来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.14,0:14:48.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.14,0:14:48.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.39,0:14:50.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon? Sheldon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.39,0:14:50.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.60,0:14:56.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.60,0:14:56.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有何指教？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.35,0:14:57.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where are my clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.35,0:14:57.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的衣服到哪儿去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.77,0:15:00.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Your clothes? -Yes. I left them in the washers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.77,0:15:00.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你的衣服？ -是的 我留在洗衣机里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.23,0:15:02.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I went to get them, they were gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.23,0:15:02.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要去拿衣服时 已经不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.28,0:15:08.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? Despite the sign that says: "Do not leave laundry unattended"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.28,0:15:08.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗？难道你没看见牌子写着 “请勿将衣物留置无人看守”吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.37,0:15:10.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, where are my clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.37,0:15:10.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 我的衣服在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.28,0:15:14.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, I do recall seeing some female undergarments.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.28,0:15:14.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}知道吗？我的确想起曾经看到一些女人衣物
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.54,0:15:17.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where was that? Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.54,0:15:17.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}到底在哪里呢？对了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.12,0:15:18.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Earlier this evening...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.12,0:15:18.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}傍晚稍早的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.88,0:15:24.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I happened to gaze out the window and a brassiere caught my eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.88,0:15:24.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我向窗外望去 看见外面有胸罩
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.38,0:15:26.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do those look familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.38,0:15:26.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那些是你的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.59,0:15:29.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How the hell did you get them up on that telephone wire?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.59,0:15:29.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎么弄到电话线上的？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.10,0:15:34.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When you understand the laws of physics, Penny, anything is possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.10,0:15:34.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 只要了解物理原理 任何事都有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.73,0:15:38.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And may I add: Mua-ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.73,0:15:38.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}容我再加一句
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.77,0:15:42.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Get them down. -Apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.77,0:15:42.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-帮我拿下来 -道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.48,0:15:43.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Never. -Then I suggest...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.48,0:15:43.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-休想 -那么 我会建议你…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.94,0:15:46.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you get a very long stick and play panty piñata.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.94,0:15:46.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}找根长长的竿子玩钩内衣游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.07,0:15:49.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, wait, Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.07,0:15:49.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}慢着 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.32,0:15:51.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This has gotten out of hand. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.32,0:15:51.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}玩笑已经开过头 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.16,0:15:54.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've done some stupid things, you've done some stupid things.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.16,0:15:54.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我做了一些蠢事 你也是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.12,0:15:56.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How about call it even, move on with our lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.12,0:15:56.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们就算扯平了 让生活回到正轨 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.50,0:15:58.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've done no stupid things.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.50,0:15:58.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有做什么蠢事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.17,0:16:00.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Look, you've gotta meet me halfway here. -I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.17,0:16:00.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你得稍微妥协一点 -我已经妥协了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.67,0:16:03.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm willing to concede that you've done some stupid things.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.67,0:16:03.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我愿意勉强承认你做了一些蠢事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.80,0:16:09.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, you guys are talking again. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.80,0:16:09.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿 你们和好了？太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.72,0:16:13.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.72,0:16:13.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}发生了什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.60,0:16:15.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard, remember when I said it was on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.60,0:16:15.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 还记得我说过好戏上场吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.68,0:16:18.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, now it's junior rodeo on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.68,0:16:18.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如今该是牛仔竞技出马的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.14,0:16:22.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, not junior rodeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.14,0:16:22.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别拿牛仔竞技那一套
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.69,0:16:25.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.69,0:16:25.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你做了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.15,0:16:28.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I had no choice, Leonard. She ruined laundry night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.15,0:16:28.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我别无选择 莱纳德 她毁了我的洗衣日
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.74,0:16:32.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.28,0:16:35.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: Mua-ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.30,0:16:48.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Telephone wires can't electrocute you, can they?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.30,0:16:48.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}电话线不会触电吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.18,0:16:51.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. Look, this has to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.18,0:16:51.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不会 听好 这场闹剧该停止了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.34,0:16:54.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, no, no, no. It is just beginning. -All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.34,0:16:54.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不 好戏才刚开始而已 -好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.85,0:16:58.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I really didn't wanna do this...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.85,0:16:58.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真的很不愿意这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.68,0:17:00.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.68,0:17:00.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拿去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.35,0:17:02.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.35,0:17:02.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.65,0:17:05.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon's kryptonite.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.65,0:17:05.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿的软肋
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.24,0:17:10.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.24,0:17:10.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老天
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.82,0:17:14.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He can never know that I gave that to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.82,0:17:14.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}千万别让他知道是我给你的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.37,0:17:17.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, I said I wanted to hurt him, but--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.37,0:17:17.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听好 我虽然说过要伤害他
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.12,0:17:19.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.12,0:17:19.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但 这个？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.79,0:17:24.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It will shorten the war by five years and save millions of lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.79,0:17:24.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这可以提早五年结束战争 拯救数百万人生命
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.46,0:17:28.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CHATTERING AND CHEERING ON TV]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.76,0:17:30.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pause it. That's it. Confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.76,0:17:30.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}暂停 找到了 确认
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.05,0:17:34.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We now have the address of the Top Model house.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.05,0:17:34.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们查到超级模特儿屋子的地址了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.30,0:17:38.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}God bless you, Google Street View registered trademark.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.30,0:17:38.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老天保佑谷歌地图街景注册商标
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.73,0:17:43.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, for the record, what you are doing is really creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.73,0:17:43.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老实说 我觉得你们太诡异了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.56,0:17:48.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If it's "creepy" to use the Internet, military satellites and robot aircraft...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.56,0:17:48.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果利用网络军事卫星及无人侦察机
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.57,0:17:50.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to find a house full of gorgeous young models...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.57,0:17:50.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}能让我找到满屋子的美丽年轻模特儿
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.07,0:17:55.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...so that I can drop in on them unexpectedly, then fine, I'm "creepy."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.07,0:17:55.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我不期而遇 造访她们 要说我诡异也没有关系
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.03,0:17:57.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[TELEPHONE RINGING]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.62,0:18:01.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.62,0:18:01.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.91,0:18:04.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, hi. Yeah, hold on a second, I'll get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.91,0:18:04.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好 请等等 我去叫他
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.12,0:18:05.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, it's for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.12,0:18:05.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你的电话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.42,0:18:06.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Who is it? -Your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.42,0:18:06.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谁打的？ -你母亲
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.09,0:18:09.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.09,0:18:09.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.59,0:18:12.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi, Mom. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.59,0:18:12.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}妈 你好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.43,0:18:15.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.43,0:18:15.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是 妈…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.60,0:18:19.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She keeps sitting in my spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.60,0:18:19.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她一直坐在我的位子上
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.68,0:18:23.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And she touched my food.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.68,0:18:23.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她还碰了我的食物
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.81,0:18:27.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, yes, I took her clothes, but she started it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.81,0:18:27.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错 我拿了她的衣服 是她先开始的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.77,0:18:30.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, that's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.77,0:18:30.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不要 这样不公平
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.78,0:18:34.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why should I have to apologize?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.78,0:18:34.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为何我该向她道歉？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.36,0:18:38.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I really don't think this is the kind of thing Jesus concerns himself with.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.36,0:18:38.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不认为耶稣会关心这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.49,0:18:43.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, you're right. I don't really know what Jesus thinks about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.49,0:18:43.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说的对 我不知道耶稣在想什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.16,0:18:44.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.16,0:18:44.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.42,0:18:46.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.42,0:18:46.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再见
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.25,0:18:52.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Did you tell on me? -Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.25,0:18:52.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-是你打我小报告？ -你在开玩笑？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.13,0:18:53.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I already have two strikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.13,0:18:53.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我已经两好球了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.06,0:19:01.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.06,0:19:01.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.81,0:19:03.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.81,0:19:03.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.56,0:19:05.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.56,0:19:05.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.94,0:19:10.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am very, very sorry for what I have done.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.94,0:19:10.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对于我的所作所为我深感抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.11,0:19:11.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here's your laundry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.11,0:19:11.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是你的衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.73,0:19:15.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I rescind your strikes and you are no longer banished.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.73,0:19:15.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我撤销了你的记录 你不再被驱逐出境了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.57,0:19:18.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can I sit wherever I want?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.57,0:19:18.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我高兴坐哪里就坐哪里吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.74,0:19:21.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.74,0:19:21.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.20,0:19:24.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Never mind. Never mind. That's not important.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.20,0:19:24.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不用了 这不重要
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.62,0:19:26.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, this was big of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.62,0:19:26.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你真是大人有大量
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.21,0:19:28.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Thank you. I really appreciate it. -Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.21,0:19:28.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢谢你 非常感激 -谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.34,0:19:32.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Good night, Sheldon. -Penny?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.34,0:19:32.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-晚安 谢尔顿 -佩妮？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.09,0:19:33.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.09,0:19:33.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.84,0:19:35.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well played.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.84,0:19:35.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}干得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.47,0:19:40.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Thank you. -Just remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.47,0:19:40.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢谢你 -你要谨记…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.76,0:19:44.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with great power comes great responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.76,0:19:44.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}能力越强 责任越重
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.64,0:19:48.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.64,0:19:48.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我懂
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.99,0:19:57.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[DOORBELL RINGS]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.49,0:20:03.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.49,0:20:03.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有何指教？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.91,0:20:06.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, we're here to fix the cable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.91,0:20:06.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们是来这里修有线电视的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.33,0:20:09.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think we have satellite.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.33,0:20:09.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想我们用的是卫星电视
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.92,0:20:13.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.92,0:20:13.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就是这么说的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.09,0:20:16.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. Okay. Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.09,0:20:16.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 请进
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.47,0:20:26.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's taller than all the women in my family combined.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.47,0:20:26.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她比我家所有女人加起来还要高
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.39,0:20:28.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.39,0:20:28.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}接下来该怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.44,0:20:34.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Follow Mrs. Wolowitz.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.44,0:20:34.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟着沃洛维茨太太就对了
